  "about": {
    "zh": "一个 Q 版动漫少女,二头半身,正面站着;橙色波浪长发披在身后、垂到膝盖,头一侧别着一朵橙色花饰、垂着黑白两色的发带;穿奶白色衬衫,配一件短披肩和长长的泡泡袖,一条长及脚踝的奶白、黑、橙三色多层长裙,黑色鞋子;平时双手捧着一本封面有朵花的棕色书",
    "en": "a chibi anime girl, two and a half heads tall, standing facing front; wavy orange hair falling behind her to the knees, an orange flower ornament with black-and-white ribbons on one side of her head; a cream blouse with a short capelet and long puffy sleeves, an ankle-long layered skirt in cream, black and orange, and black shoes; she usually holds a brown book with a flower on its cover"
  },
  "author": "Coopanion",
  "credits": [
    {
      "role": "角色设定",
      "name": "ZipZipPipe（Bilibili）"
    }
